        "body": "Aurora Innovation, Inc. is a for-profit public company headquartered in Pittsburgh, PA, trading under the ticker AUR. Its website describes the company as focused on self-driving freight, with a system called the Aurora Driver that it says is built with cutting-edge hardware and software backed by verifiable AI. The site presents the Aurora Driver as integrating autonomy into trucking fleets and includes statements from partners about a pilot program hauling freight between Fort Worth and El Paso, as well as integration with the Volvo VNL Autonomous. The site also states that freight volumes are projected to grow five fold between 2010 and 2050.\n\nPublic records list the company's CIK as 0001828108 and show 155 Pennsylvania law exposure entries. No litigation cases are listed in the available data.",
